[SECTION]
TITLE: 11. Certification Statement

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Based on the evidence contained in the software lifecycle data, the Flight Management System software version 2.1.0 has been developed in compliance with DO-178C requirements for Design Assurance Level A.

All software verification objectives have been satisfied, and the software is suitable for certification and operational use in accordance with the approved system safety assessment.

The software has been verified to satisfy all high-level and low-level requirements. Structural coverage analysis demonstrates 100% MC/DC coverage has been achieved. All reviews have been completed with findings resolved. Configuration management has maintained control of all software artifacts throughout the lifecycle.
<<<

[/SECTION]

